# ============================================================================
#  JANGAN hapus baris data/rahasia di bawah ini.
#
#  `live_check.db` berisi 531 personel (nama, nomor kartu, NIK) + 2392 log akses,
#  dan `*.xls` adalah ekspor HR. Kalau berkas itu pernah masuk satu commit saja,
#  data itu ikut tercatat di riwayat git dan tetap bisa diambil walau dihapus
#  setelahnya. Menuliskannya SEBELUM commit pertama adalah satu-satunya cara
#  yang benar-benar aman.
# ============================================================================

# --- database & data pribadi -------------------------------------------------
*.db
*.db.*
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.bak
*.xls
*.xlsx
backup new.bak
Personnel_*.xls
Departmenet.xls

# --- rahasia -----------------------------------------------------------------
.env
*.env
!.env.example
CHECK-REPORT.txt
BACKEND-SNIPPET.txt

# --- log (bisa memuat token/IP panel) ----------------------------------------
logs/
*.log
*.log.*
agent.out.log*

# --- Python ------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- artefak build/installer (puluhan MB, bisa dibangun ulang) ---------------
zkteco-backend/agent/installer/.cache/
zkteco-backend/agent/installer/dist/
zkteco-backend/deploy/*.tar.gz
zkteco-backend/deploy/*.zip

# --- OS / editor -------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.log.1
